# ForexWizard AI Market Brain — frontend environment template
# Copy this file to .env.local and adjust if your backend is not on port 8000.
# Anything starting with NEXT_PUBLIC_ is visible to website visitors — never put
# API keys, broker credentials, or database passwords here.

